<title>POLAND: Polish housing output falls 0.2 pct m/m in Nov.</title>
<headline>Polish housing output falls 0.2 pct m/m in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in November fell 0.2 percent from October and was 11.8 percent lower than in November 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 5,149 dwellings were completed in November bringing the total for the January-November period to 43,079.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	     NOVEMBER  OCTOBER	NOV 1995</p>
<p> month/month pct change	     -0.2	25.0	  -5.0</p>
<p> number of dwellings built	   5,149    5,158	  5,062</p>
